cta_title: Broken Down on the M23 Right Now?
===BODY===
          <h2>A short motorway with a lot of traffic</h2>
          <p>The M23 runs only about 17 miles, from junction 7 of the <a href="{{R}}routes/m25.html">M25</a> near Merstham, south past Redhill to Gatwick and Crawley, ending at Pease Pottage, where it becomes the A23 towards Brighton. Much of it is smart motorway, so watch the overhead signs and look for emergency areas if your car starts to struggle.</p>

          <h2>Gatwick Airport (junction 9)</h2>
          <p>Junction 9 serves Gatwick Airport through a short spur road. Airport car parks are one of the most common places for a car not to start, after a week or two of standing, especially in cold weather. Tell us which terminal and car park, and roughly where you parked. A <a href="{{R}}guides/flat-battery-jump-start-or-recovery.html">jump start</a> may be all it needs.</p>

          <h2>Crawley and the road to Brighton</h2>
          <p>South of Gatwick the motorway passes Crawley and ends at Pease Pottage, where there are services. The A23 continues south to Brighton as a dual carriageway. If you've broken down on the A23, tell us that you're past the end of the motorway, and the nearest junction or village.</p>

          <div class="callout">
            <p><strong>If you break down on the M23:</strong> on smart motorway sections, aim for an emergency area. If you're stuck in a live lane and can't get out safely, stay in the car with your seatbelt on and call 999. Then call us with your direction and the last junction you passed.</p>
          </div>
===FAQ===
Q: My car won't start in a Gatwick car park. Can you help?
A: Yes. Tell us which terminal and car park and where the car is. If a jump start is likely to work we'll say so, and if not we'll recover the car home or to your garage.
Q: Do you cover the A23 to Brighton as well?
A: Yes. We arrange recovery on the A23 and in Brighton and Crawley too.
Q: How much does recovery from the M23 cost?
A: Local recovery starts from £125, with a fixed price agreed before we set off.
